---
name: len
---

# len

The number of cells in a list of floats — a thin wrapper over the
`list_len` primitive, so specs and prose in this module can say `len xs`.

```soil-sig
len : (xs : List F64) -> I64
```

```ensures
non-negative: result >= 0
```

```test counts
([]) => 0
([1.0, 2.5, 3.0]) => 3
```
